  "outcome": "The original HGRP/Lit HGBuffer stages, GBuffer renderer-list LightMode, five-color-target DefaultDeferred render-graph topology, HGRP deferred resolver shader family, HighEnd GBuffer formats, native draw entry points, unpatched render-parameter initializer, and current installed CharInfo draw route are recovered. A default-off same-camera SphereOutside sidecar now binds the exact logical five-MRT formats plus D32S8, applies the source material's depth/stencil state and transform, and produces bit-identical 640x720 readbacks on D3D11 and D3D12 without changing the presented beauty frame. The selected pass-0 _TransformVariables b30 reads are source-closed for view, inverse-view, inverse GPU view-projection, and camera-position fields. The selected _LightDataBuffer b31 reads are also source-closed for the isolated Wulfa/Zhuangfy CharInfo fixture: native allocation is six header vectors plus 256 eight-vector punctual records, the directional header is exact, and each CharacterOnly row exits before unresolved general-light or shadow words. Both full buffers publish bit-exactly on D3D11/D3D12 with unknown words zero. These transports remain non-presented/default-off and never enable pass 0. The selected physical Gacha camera is source-closed RenderWithAlpha=false, so the callback invokes the WriteAlpha helper but submits no WriteAlpha draws. Future/network patch state, render-graph physical resource identity/lifetime, a binding-compatible pass-0 implementation, general-scene punctual payloads, and remaining frame-produced lighting resources are not recovered. A forward/PBR substitute is not equivalent and must not activate SphereOutside.",
